Common ProgramParticipation [522]
    deprecated "Users of this element are advised to use ProgramParticipationStatus instead. Expect removal of this element in a future release."
    documentation "Programs the student is participating in or receiving services from."
    descriptor ProgramType [904]
        documentation "The type of program."
        is part of identity
    descriptor ProgramCharacteristic [903]
        documentation "Reflects important characteristics of the program, such as categories or particular indications."
        is optional collection
    date BeginDate [900]
        documentation "The date the student was associated with the program or service."
        is optional
    date EndDate [902]
        documentation "The date the program participation ended."
        is optional
    shared string DesignatedBy [901]
        documentation "The person, organization, or department that designated the program association."
        is optional
